{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a257ea8e7848c8ae75ff97fb9a588ba2cbb9b62174a84039e2cf3a9369d8fc52", "ja": "（『聖ミリオン女学園』の撮影が終わった。\n今回も、アイドル達の熱演が光っていたな……）", "zh": "（《圣百万女学园》的拍摄结束了。这次偶像们的精彩演技也大放异彩啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "545d534124f0b3953fdeedf4ee6da5fee53cd1c2b84ac9511100bdd8038d6159", "ja": "あずささんたちはラベンダー……。\n佐竹さんと所さんは、アルメリアね。こっちは……。", "zh": "梓小姐她们是薰衣草……  \n佐竹小姐和所小姐是海石竹呢。这边是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f8afeb0f7395c8e9fc03565f1e853c91d8f39833ebc399cfa94024ced8d6798d", "ja": "お疲れ様、千早。\nその写真……全部、ミリオン女学園のものか？", "zh": "辛苦了，千早。\n那张照片……全都是百万学园的照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "9e1c7febfaf2ed0ea19d144da7c59ebaeac0ccdccb96bdafc09c9dcbe20cbbee", "ja": "はい。最初は、景色や建物を撮っていたんですけど。\n永吉さんに、みんなのことも撮ってほしいと言われて。", "zh": "是的。最开始，我拍的都是风景和建筑，不过永吉同学希望我也拍下大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ac6ddf0678fd3c75aca8747f1ada06b74ba0fb740f2ef144892a40e723c8383e", "ja": "そうなのか。こうして改めて写真で見ると、\n姉妹ごとに、それぞれの色がある気がするな。", "zh": "原来如此。像这样重新从照片中看，感觉每对姐妹都有各自的特色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "e119120148d52cc60cf56df0034fc5e83ac3e11faddb5ea6698e61015485d382", "ja": "そうですね。クラスや部活での出番もありましたけど、\n姉妹で一緒にいる時間が、一番長かったですから。", "zh": "是啊。虽然也有在班级和社团活动中出场的时候，但毕竟还是和姐妹一起度过的时间最长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "1eb0059a997aae21eeeeb108420fe44c8b611505f2255662a5c756cd856cf062", "ja": "{$P$}。\nこの写真、見てもらえますか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n可以请您看看这张照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1007_p", "source_sha256": "00ced487c5ca2deaf2f4ac751959c47540b6d2e1eca1b0357ae4f36425e09c6d", "ja": "どれどれ？　おお、すごいブレてるな……。\nこれは、千早と可憐か？", "zh": "我看看？哦，拍得也太晃了吧……  \n这是千早和可怜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "c46daa04c2cf172d5e7927cd65161cb005146944d11cec51b8de898b67811da6", "ja": "正解です。……この写真は、\n永吉さんが撮ってくれたものなんです。", "zh": "答对了。……这张照片是永吉拍的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e8118029acdce8620d742bdf4a731787eda8d3eeb18f296305d7387b3b530461", "ja": "へえ……。\nなんというか、昴らしさが出てるというか。", "zh": "哦……该怎么说呢，很有昴的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "8e9243e9673ae2b91c037148780e39c2e2f041814ee9dd018ed30f702b71d08a", "ja": "ええ。「たまには、千早も写ってよ！」って。\nそれで、カメラを渡したんですけど。", "zh": "是的。她说：“千早，偶尔也一起入镜嘛！”  \n所以我就把相机交给她了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "2c5a77e687e6301e2118056afd36e60f37629aa5eb59a1add05520e204481167", "ja": "どういう訳か、何度撮っても失敗してしまうので、\n永吉さんがすっかり落ち込んでしまって。", "zh": "不知为何，无论拍多少次都失败了，永吉小姐也因此彻底消沉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ff656aeebeab0f0904b6a94bd03528b27f7e54e2b1d497d850457414f46703e6", "ja": "そんなに？\n昴、テンションが上がってたのかな……。", "zh": "有那么夸张吗？\n昴当时是不是太兴奋了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "cc963dc1c092596183620270e59b31936d8cb081c10b4d3e89c363fdff1053ca", "ja": "そうかもしれませんね。\n最後に撮れたのが、これで。", "zh": "或许吧。最后拍下来的，就是这张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "0d4678bd63d0687fbc9829215b6a9b49fd9d9d22d0841253ec06859201121cf3", "ja": "永吉さんは、消してほしいって言ったんですけど。\n……私は、なんだか残しておきたかったんです。", "zh": "永吉小姐说想删掉，不过……\n不知为什么，我想把它留着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fe4b5f5db35504c322961a74fb9ba9cbf26b8a25cdeed040304204892e29601c", "ja": "うん。\n千早達3人の思い出が、詰まってるもんな。", "zh": "嗯。\n毕竟里面凝聚着千早她们3个人的回忆啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "a0251eaad20538d08c93bc69a911962a5e8ba69ed6c6cedf2b056ba89c9db914", "ja": "はい。それで、アルバムを作っていたんですけど……\nせっかくだから、姉妹ごとに作ってみようと思って。", "zh": "是的。那个相册里装满了我们三人的回忆……  \n难得有这个机会，我想按姐妹分别制作相册。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2a2a7860be48c1097ceea167b9466f60362c7225aa9f6bf803d525de3d606403", "ja": "それはいいアイディアだな！\nいい思い出になりそうだ。", "zh": "这主意不错啊！\n感觉会成为一段美好的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "226999a7650f8f2d890d700e123a9171c3d7ee95a64527fa1673c8c2e8425df6", "ja": "はい。……みんなとこのアルバムを見ながら、\nそれぞれの姉妹を振り返る事もできますし。", "zh": "是的……大家也可以一边看着这本相册，一边回顾各自的姐妹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0623_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "8cdfd58e08cdc247123464c220862c08977d43c24d2b5b9d8de3e799a6935730", "ja": "その時は、{$P$}も一緒に。\n私たちの思い出には、欠かせない存在ですから。", "zh": "到那时，{$P$}也一起来吧。因为在我们的回忆中，您是不可或缺的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
